EXPERIMENT 0007 - NOT FOR COMMIT. NV12 + MUTABLE: keep tiling, drop only UBWC.

The code argument for a driver-side fix of the planar branch (probe N2) is
that for a planar base format MUTABLE changes only the *compression*, not the
layout:

  - tu_image_view_init maps an R8_UNORM view of PLANE_0 straight back to
    PIPE_FORMAT_Y8_UNORM ("The 0'th plane of this format has a different UBWC
    compression"), i.e. it treats the reinterpretation as layout-identical;
  - the plane-0 layout is built with exactly that format (tu6_plane_format ->
    PIPE_FORMAT_Y8_UNORM, handed to the layout in tu_image_init).

If that holds, `ubwc_enabled = false` alone is enough in the NV12 branch and
`force_linear_tile = true` is redundant. That has a concrete payoff: with
tiling kept, 0004's own check (it rejects any SPARSE_RESIDENCY image whose
tile_mode is not TILE6_3) stops firing, so NV12 + MUTABLE + SPARSE becomes
creatable and the one-line vkd3d fix for the planar branch is not needed at
all. It is also a general win rather than a gen2 quirk: NV12 + MUTABLE is
ordinary for video, and those images are linear today.

What this patch does: delete `force_linear_tile = true;` from the NV12 branch
and nothing else. UBWC is still disabled, so the compression argument the
branch is built on is respected; only the tiling demotion goes away.

How to read the result: probe W compares PLANE_0's subresource layout against
a real tiled R8_UNORM image of the same geometry, and round-trips plane 0
through a transfer. Layout identity is what the code argument rests on. Caveat
kept deliberately in the test comment: layout identity does not prove the
sampling path (a new R8 sampling shader would be needed for that), and the
transfer path cannot carry a view at all - vkCmdCopyImageToBuffer takes a
VkImage, so "read plane 0 through an R8_UNORM view" is not expressible as a
copy.

--- a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_image.cc
+++ b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_image.cc
@@ -555,7 +555,6 @@
                   fmt_list ? "present" : "missing");
             }
             ubwc_enabled = false;
-            force_linear_tile = true;
          } else if (!mutable_ubwc_fc) {
             if (ubwc_enabled) {
                if (fmt_list && fmt_list->viewFormatCount == 2) {
